@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Feature 003 - Copy Student Link with Honest Feedback
actor Teacher
participant "Copy button / same visible URL" as UI
participant "Browser Clipboard" as Clipboard
Teacher -> UI : Click / Enter / Space
UI -> UI : validate URL, capture context + epoch; pending
alt no supported clipboard capability
  UI --> Teacher : explicit failure + selectable full URL
else available
  UI -> Clipboard : writeText(displayedStudentUrl) immediately
  opt activity / auth / boot / unmount changes
    UI -> UI : invalidate epoch and reset pending feedback
  end
  alt resolved and original context still valid
    Clipboard --> UI : success
    UI --> Teacher : copied confirmation within 1 second
  else rejected and original context still valid
    Clipboard --> UI : failure
    UI --> Teacher : failure + manual copy instruction
  else old context
    Clipboard --> UI : late resolve / reject
    UI -> UI : ignore stale feedback; never write old URL again
  end
end
note over UI,Clipboard
Never read clipboard, never await network before writeText.
Do not claim existing browser write can be canceled or undone.
A copied URL has no OAuth / CSRF / teacher cookie data.
end note
@enduml
